# C# Style

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) File Checklist.

- File-scoped namespaces; prefer `sealed` and primary constructors
- K&R braces; `var` when type is obvious
- Short guards and returns may span 1–2 lines for readability
- Expression-bodied members when clear
- Do not compress entire methods into one unreadable line
